   "ruling": "Ruling: owner ruling (register entry amb.2025.ira_se_floor); project retained. person.ira_se, now shown in the glossary, is each person's Schedule C profit or loss less that person's Schedule 1 lines 15 and 16 deductions, floored at zero per person (i1040gi p. 98, line 9, \"Enter the earned income you (and your spouse if filing jointly) received as a self-employed individual or a partner, minus any deductions on Schedule 1, lines 15 and 16. If zero or less, enter -0-\"); whether one spouse's loss nets against the other's earnings is the ambiguity the owner settled. Partnership earned income is refused before this line by the Schedule SE screen (person.se_screened, 'partnership and other self-employment income'), so only Schedule C earnings reach it.",
